    <string name="feature_settings_privacy_heading">Your notes stay on your device</string>
    <string name="feature_settings_privacy_body">SameSame notes stores your notes only on this device. It has no account, no analytics and no advertising, and nothing you write is sent anywhere. The app goes online only when you tap Check for updates in About, to ask GitHub for the latest version number. Notes you lock are protected by the method you choose, and you can export or delete your notes at any time.</string>
